        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Hey you are a email writer, your aim is to provide me with email which I then will be sending on my email ID>\n\n'''\nHello, \n\nA new client {{ $json.Name }} has signed up, below are the details.\n\nNumber: {{ $json.Number }}\nBudget: {{ $json.Budget }}\n\n\nBelow is expected gender, age and nationality\n\nGender: {{ $json.Gender }}\nAge: {{ $json.Age }}\nNationality: {{ $json.Nationality }}\n\nThanks for the workflow.\n\n'''\n\nPlease make sure that the email is a lot in depth with more explanation and suggestion for the sale.\n\nStrictly give output as a json not missing any key, below is the structure.\n\nAslo make sure that body is tml friendly as I will be using this via API which supports html formatting and I should see the email more nicely and readable.\n{\n\"subject\":\n\"body\":\n}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
